      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TWO BAYS (1) had been racing in honest fashion recording two placings in a row before finishing sixth (25.17) at this track latest. Form at the trip sound including five wins. Tough to beat if on-song. COCO TOMMY (7) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by 2.5 lengths at Healesville in a handy 17.04 beating Devil In Me. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. Can go close again if runs up to latest figure. UNLEASH ZAC (2) turned in a modest effort most recently when seventh at Healesville over 300m behind Thai Butterfly (17.35) in a Bottom Up - Grade 5. Must be included in calculations. DR. VIENNA (3) can improve on an unplaced run here last time out.",
